WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.620 --> 00:00:04.010
- [Joey] So pretty much
everyone knows that one guy,

00:00:04.010 --> 00:00:07.410
who on New Year's Eve
proclaims to all of his friends

00:00:07.410 --> 00:00:10.150
his ambitious plans to
go to the gym every day

00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:13.950
or wake up at 7:00 am every
morning for the whole year.

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:16.140
And they go and buy new workout clothes,

00:00:16.140 --> 00:00:18.070
install habit tracking apps,

00:00:18.070 --> 00:00:20.200
and are elated by the prospect

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:23.710
of becoming that awesome person
they've always wanted to be.

00:00:23.710 --> 00:00:25.711
In fact, they're so excited about it,

00:00:25.711 --> 00:00:29.260
it's as if they actually,
you know, did something.

00:00:29.260 --> 00:00:31.170
But before a single day is completed,

00:00:31.170 --> 00:00:33.750
they'll bombard you with
incessant monologues

00:00:33.750 --> 00:00:36.310
about all the benefits
they're going to experience

00:00:36.310 --> 00:00:38.660
and how life-changing it's gonna be.

00:00:38.660 --> 00:00:40.810
But you almost can't
help but roll your eyes,

00:00:40.810 --> 00:00:43.370
because you know they're
just talking about it,

00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:44.810
not actually doing it.

00:00:44.810 --> 00:00:46.830
One of the things I've
learned over the years is

00:00:46.830 --> 00:00:50.560
that nobody cares about what
you say you're going to do,

00:00:50.560 --> 00:00:52.180
and you shouldn't either.

00:00:52.180 --> 00:00:55.610
No matter how much you flap
your jaw, nothing moves,

00:00:55.610 --> 00:00:57.980
and having ambition isn't special.

00:00:57.980 --> 00:00:59.650
Almost everyone has ambition.

00:00:59.650 --> 00:01:01.040
Whatever your goal in life is,

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:03.280
there are likely millions of other people

00:01:03.280 --> 00:01:05.520
with that exact same goal,

00:01:05.520 --> 00:01:07.740
unless you have like a really weird goal,

00:01:07.740 --> 00:01:09.400
like performing a puppet show

00:01:09.400 --> 00:01:11.110
on top of Mount Everest or something.

00:01:11.110 --> 00:01:13.890
But telling somebody that
you're going to do something

00:01:13.890 --> 00:01:18.890
isn't impressive to anyone in
any way and never has been.

00:01:18.910 --> 00:01:20.080
And it never will be.

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:22.530
So instead of humble
bragging to your roommate

00:01:22.530 --> 00:01:25.750
about how you're gonna start
taking the gym more seriously

00:01:25.750 --> 00:01:28.068
or start eating clean from now on,

00:01:28.068 --> 00:01:30.210
try giving your tongue a little rest

00:01:30.210 --> 00:01:32.500
and actually get a few days, weeks,

00:01:32.500 --> 00:01:34.500
or even months under your belt.

00:01:34.500 --> 00:01:37.130
Learn to embrace the
process of pushing yourself

00:01:37.130 --> 00:01:39.530
and achieving things
when nobody is watching

00:01:39.530 --> 00:01:42.300
because after all, who are
you doing this for anyways?

00:01:42.300 --> 00:01:44.620
Do you genuinely want to build a company,

00:01:44.620 --> 00:01:46.817
or do you just crave the patronizing,

00:01:46.817 --> 00:01:48.580
"Oh, that's cool man, good for you,"

00:01:48.580 --> 00:01:50.030
that you get for mentioning it.

00:01:50.030 --> 00:01:50.920
The way I see it,

00:01:50.920 --> 00:01:53.520
there are only four types
of people in this world.

00:01:53.520 --> 00:01:55.820
Those who talk the talk and walk the walk.

00:01:55.820 --> 00:01:58.630
Those who talk the talk
and don't walk the walk.

00:01:58.630 --> 00:02:01.830
Those who don't talk the
talk and don't walk the walk.

00:02:01.830 --> 00:02:02.663
And finally,

00:02:02.663 --> 00:02:05.340
those who don't talk the
talk, but walk the walk.

00:02:05.340 --> 00:02:07.520
And I would argue that this final option

00:02:07.520 --> 00:02:10.570
is the best option you
should strive towards,

00:02:10.570 --> 00:02:13.430
because those who talk
the talk and walk the walk

00:02:13.430 --> 00:02:14.570
are usually annoying,

00:02:14.570 --> 00:02:16.920
and they brag about the
fact that they do things.

00:02:16.920 --> 00:02:19.730
Those who talk the talk
and don't walk the walk

00:02:19.730 --> 00:02:22.110
are even worse because they pretend

00:02:22.110 --> 00:02:25.150
that they do all these things,
but they're just talking.

00:02:25.150 --> 00:02:27.660
And the saddest of the
bunch, number three,

00:02:27.660 --> 00:02:31.210
are those who don't talk the
talk and don't walk the walk,

00:02:31.210 --> 00:02:32.760
pretty self-explanatory,

00:02:32.760 --> 00:02:35.960
yeah, just a generally
uninspiring crowd to be around.

00:02:35.960 --> 00:02:36.960
And number four,

00:02:36.960 --> 00:02:40.210
those who don't talk the
talk, but walk the walk,

00:02:40.210 --> 00:02:42.520
these are the coolest
people on planet earth.

00:02:42.520 --> 00:02:44.820
This is the guy who's absolutely ripped,

00:02:44.820 --> 00:02:46.260
but doesn't talk about it.

00:02:46.260 --> 00:02:48.350
The guy who drives an insanely nice car,

00:02:48.350 --> 00:02:50.360
but few people know what
he does for a living.

00:02:50.360 --> 00:02:53.350
His lifestyle is proof, in and of itself,

00:02:53.350 --> 00:02:57.030
of rigorous discipline, hard
work, patience, et cetera,

00:02:57.030 --> 00:02:58.440
but he doesn't flaunt it,

00:02:58.440 --> 00:03:01.520
unless it's with a legitimate
accountability partner

00:03:01.520 --> 00:03:04.260
or group that you actually take seriously.

00:03:04.260 --> 00:03:08.180
Speaking before you do
is just a useless step

00:03:08.180 --> 00:03:09.790
in the way of actually doing.

00:03:09.790 --> 00:03:11.810
Otherwise, you're just seeking validation

00:03:11.810 --> 00:03:13.840
for something you haven't even done yet.

00:03:13.840 --> 00:03:16.020
So here's a personal challenge from me,

00:03:16.020 --> 00:03:19.060
go achieve something you've
always wanted to achieve,

00:03:19.060 --> 00:03:21.510
something you've been
putting off for a long time,

00:03:21.510 --> 00:03:24.660
and something that would
dramatically improve your life,

00:03:24.660 --> 00:03:27.030
and when you're done, don't tell a soul.

00:03:27.030 --> 00:03:27.950
I guarantee you

00:03:27.950 --> 00:03:30.830
this will improve the
way you look at yourself.

00:03:30.830 --> 00:03:32.980
It will bolster your self efficacy.

00:03:32.980 --> 00:03:35.060
You'll carry around this confidence.

00:03:35.060 --> 00:03:37.110
It's like your own dirty little secret,

00:03:37.110 --> 00:03:39.750
and it'll permeate every
aspect of your being,

00:03:39.750 --> 00:03:41.720
your interactions with other people,

00:03:41.720 --> 00:03:43.900
and you'll secretly know
that you're a bad-ass,

00:03:43.900 --> 00:03:46.350
and you didn't have to tell anybody.

